### 6. Metrics (Required for Thesis)
- Repair accuracy (% correct root cause identification)
- MTTR (Mean Time To Repair)
- Abstention rate (when uncertainty too high)
- Destructive action rate (incorrect actions)

### 7. Self-Healing Definition
Self-healing = Identify root cause + Mitigate properly
- Auto-recovery, no human intervention
- Safe (refuse to act if uncertain)
- Distributed (runs across continuum)

## Two-Step Process (CRITICAL)
1. **Root Cause Identification** with certainty ≥85% (multiple agents consensus)
2. **VFE check** (below threshold) confirms safe to execute
3. **Execute Healing Action** only if both checks pass

## Code Style
- Clean, well-commented
- Ready for thesis defense
- Reproducible experiments
- Clear separation: root cause → VFE check → healing
- Parallel micro-agents for specialized checks
